msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We meet at last..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……ようやく……、⟪k:5⟫あなたに会えましたね……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_7F8EE5F7_11D1_4996_A0CA_9123B8E172A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 753553a0be1d1f14fd65a850384ea93c3a4ae12ee7c4f3a1ada11491f38ae967
#. default-sha256: 90d29f783b11c5eb4459d4aeb423824175acfa7dea8de75df0a9e8083c492c0b
