msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_EF768DFA_9AB5_4F1E_9BAC_8B54FEC7F54E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why is there a sword in your hands?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その剣は……、⟪k:1⟫なんなんだ……？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_68EEC317_9276_4E14_A303_77624A0F3FB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5209a02c1faa1b5f04946dc2ed3ce09ce36ed89d333afa6fd6eadba2602349f6
#. default-sha256: 1f260df94b4f3fdc49e25531a6535c671a8331c0bef25486e320b7d6649d361a
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_68EEC317_9276_4E14_A303_77624A0F3FB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I realize that it’s cruel for me to ask this of you,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and for that, I deeply "
"apologize."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなたに……、⟪k:1⟫とても酷いことを強いている気持ちはあります。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫それを……申し訳なくも"
"思っています。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_148F91BC_E4C1_467E_B6E2_A38C3FA5AEE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08c83d1d8a250292971bdf5526f7414898a1a951af86fbfcf0482b1696ef5c69
#. default-sha256: 6f9b0b1da8e0199e5c8daac6875b8def5543d5e3958acbd3622f39afb9b7bb8e
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_148F91BC_E4C1_467E_B6E2_A38C3FA5AEE7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s not why I sought the truth...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Not because I wanted to see anyone "
"“extinguished”..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私は……、⟪k:1⟫誰かを消滅させるために……、⟪k:2⟫動いたわけじゃない……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_04875D08_CAE1_4730_9063_7003DD5C6999
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9aa08d73c9932d051003941478cbc1e6750d0e9430fb75659f0e353d4dd99cf1
#. default-sha256: aac8bb2b3f23f504d6565eb0767e53bceb9b483a87d89a2a11f3db75096b2e80
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_04875D08_CAE1_4730_9063_7003DD5C6999"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Because I wanted to put an ⟪k:1⟫end⟪k:2⟫ to this cycle of pain and suffering..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫誰も報われない連鎖を……、⟪k:1⟫止めるために……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_DE0645BD_A94B_49F2_97B1_549192018D30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72ce7d727d5c6a22da471281a5d72e745aa48dd6893a4df95a74414f72b4856f
#. default-sha256: 072bdc2e24cb3394f8f32f380480f1270510e722c6ba058c6fa6bf3327fb9fd4
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_DE0645BD_A94B_49F2_97B1_549192018D30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That includes you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それは……、⟪k:1⟫お前のことだって……、⟪k:2⟫例外ではなかった……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_47FB5147_8F88_4FBA_BD47_47D48530ED8A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37ae25d8fde24075f5b862e29f86bc8b715286bce0c78586dcd8967d2bb55acc
#. default-sha256: d58d0a4bb7b0742cabde63ae9adf843399e1a3e4afe1b5314d3ae3bd1d00fbd4
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_47FB5147_8F88_4FBA_BD47_47D48530ED8A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was not a victim in the tragedies...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I am culpable for them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私は……悲劇に巻き込まれる被害者ではなく……。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫悲劇を起こす加害者であったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_830104B4_BEF4_412F_BDDC_A90871F518EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca9a112977c30826785f4d5a84daff52286342af30bf9ddec6eabc7345635c48
#. default-sha256: f128a42ab6aa174260ea047169aab61ff4dcec696ef8920aa52cd45edf235dc6
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_830104B4_BEF4_412F_BDDC_A90871F518EB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I saw everything, from start to finish."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私は……、⟪k:1⟫見てきたんだ……。⟪k:2⟫ずっと……、⟪k:3⟫お前のことを……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_0AE6046F_3ED5_40C0_85EA_E230A5B45AA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
