msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_3E50B9A6_CAE2_4F7F_8B64_AC4D3DF8CAE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02f548c5e1af7709ef9a920ea1c80ca49201a21da21daefd77056de8444b19f0
#. default-sha256: 554282b0ae938c9d37a4594e14580894fccc3e30edba5fedf03ee86cbca0dcfc
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_3E50B9A6_CAE2_4F7F_8B64_AC4D3DF8CAE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was, as you ascertained, created by Morgana’s mind as it broke down in that tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私は、⟪k:1⟫あなたが暴いたように、⟪k:2⟫追いつめられたモルガーナの精神が作り出してしまった人格"
"です。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_E4F254F0_79F2_42C0_A49A_1A604A14E118
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a35f62ca5bedbd7b8531df051568e89a9bd5fe3b0d591bb76ea6d643098b1787
#. default-sha256: 3d3a85f3afe0cfc8de1248361b2025ba1868d5ee28722c042d795379412cc12b
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_E4F254F0_79F2_42C0_A49A_1A604A14E118"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The fact that she viewed herself as a saint only served to amplify that agony."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女の苦痛を増長させたのは、⟪k:1⟫彼女が聖女であるという枷でした。⟪k:2⟫聖女という概念は、⟪k:3⟫"
"彼女にとっての存在意義であり――"

#: scenario9:scenario9_19D976E8_DA0B_4502_90FC_4BD8611A2DAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86bc365f4b2d3648dcef56c45218293f6e8e20b74d3e22228b14b919cefc9b52
#. default-sha256: 98995cbd6d32710b8323e3a428ae2b0fe105b84f2b2587b11f95ff25a61a60e8
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_19D976E8_DA0B_4502_90FC_4BD8611A2DAD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wanted to hate them, but her identity would not allow her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Those two "
"conflicting aspects of her self tore Morgana apart.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She was unable to withstand it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫憎みたいのに、⟪k:1⟫聖女という枷が邪魔をする……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫その激しい苦しみに、⟪k:4⟫彼女は、"
"⟪k:5⟫耐えきれませんでした。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_20348580_23F0_480E_B537_06DE51FCD92D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47be185029380c09201642efd512a4d3f67df0888ac24f8954af65566b4c6bc0
#. default-sha256: c6c11e9cbc836450b8909550170c482e6c88d8789d7519b642197d8e66c9ae75
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_20348580_23F0_480E_B537_06DE51FCD92D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When you came to the mansion and resurrected Morgana,⟪k:1⟫you resurrected me as well. ⟪k:2⟫"
"But I had no “self” at first."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなたが館を訪れ、⟪k:1⟫モルガーナを蘇らせた時……、⟪k:2⟫私も同じように蘇りました。⟪k:3⟫けれど、"
"⟪k:4⟫私という意思は、⟪k:5⟫どこにもなかったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_8F2F6F70_E9CD_4537_BD1D_4E10BA755ECD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d928ad499181f08ad7023e8decb82e614c6b96b966f9ae7741b25d9548f59dd
#. default-sha256: 5f5b037712a09ced8993911a2e29bcf30814addabfa2ec443383220be0ae4ccd
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_8F2F6F70_E9CD_4537_BD1D_4E10BA755ECD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was, I suppose, not much different than the particles of dust floating around the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫言うなれば……、⟪k:1⟫館に漂う物質のひとつであったと思います。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_345DE38B_7BBA_447C_85FD_38908279F629
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2edf82dc23f04bc76f321bd82ada411582af3e118e42a2f0090e17a39ad5cc43
#. default-sha256: 1e9ac47af654527bf8a0285ec553f92764e907c8d87ccd614a97dba865ca1c10
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_345DE38B_7BBA_447C_85FD_38908279F629"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and descended into the realm of man and the fate which governs it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そして、⟪k:1⟫意思を持ってしまった私は、⟪k:2⟫人の運命の輪に下りてしまったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_3E9DBD4F_9BD0_4586_B216_C3C3AD288452
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c249c7c113077a52d93b71c190036477e966876c9b1f9ff3e80720bad8f1e616
#. default-sha256: 813db53bcb2120ee1413cef5d44ff4531d271ea7104b232984f3ecdbe191d3f4
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_3E9DBD4F_9BD0_4586_B216_C3C3AD288452"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What do you think the first thing a new soul wishes for when it is born, Michel?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ミシェル……、⟪k:1⟫産まれたばかりの存在は、⟪k:2⟫何を願うと思いますか？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_CB0407A9_E339_4D48_B7DA_0AE8D959EE69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10c8dec2b7b20f597e8d8cccb7652ced8bbeebc8f426be965f7e8df03a970f9b
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
