msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_CDE192CC_D8E1_483D_ADDA_BF5B772FFBF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93c6d7583eb28d1822c03ad4b8ec0d884c400847601109c19f726dfcd53dccdb
#. default-sha256: 67c241a301aca6de9669a3e3368a5ed6c3fd17562ba16e8eccc2edd97ef8d770
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_CDE192CC_D8E1_483D_ADDA_BF5B772FFBF8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that there’s anything wrong with wanting to live."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まさか……、⟪k:1⟫そう言うつもりなのか……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_427B61FA_F1B1_48B4_A6BF_CD32FDF16F18
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d22631e8b09b546f4330e680f58cded1c7727ba5a7b102d5ca7da99c6471e795
#. default-sha256: b7049f5b7c6f9260fa4ae32ca1c6aec00bbe89d57ca27cfed891cc4090969573
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_427B61FA_F1B1_48B4_A6BF_CD32FDF16F18"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was supposed to remain within Morgana, as a part of her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫本来、⟪k:1⟫私はひとつの魂になる存在ではなかったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_107F121F_562F_4D89_9F82_76A29429BD7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2597fc4bd0a5958d6a745022219fe4fbe1f1efb34adc6872c9febc4a99a3dabd
#. default-sha256: 37f4119859fe4d1f22a7bf804a02d5acc52f438edf3789abaeda4b636a89d17f
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_107F121F_562F_4D89_9F82_76A29429BD7B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To become one... ⟪k:1⟫was to turn against the laws of the universe."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その私が、⟪k:1⟫人として存在を得るということは――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫世のことわりから、⟪k:4⟫外れたこと"
"だったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_B3DA77E1_8EE0_4E8D_964B_3B154B0396F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 114cb8bc60234c11d251a95179ea6c2115452e455a1e5552079fb050842cbb3f
#. default-sha256: 5ca8699a39657b1e9b96d2a61c44ba47de7f92d1d4917f2cc5be18698a3ae34e
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_B3DA77E1_8EE0_4E8D_964B_3B154B0396F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Because that was where she lingered—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the girl from which I was formed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それは、⟪k:1⟫私の存在の元となった彼女が、⟪k:2⟫そこに残っていたからです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_13865182_DB1B_4F73_B3AA_181FDF2483F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be6f74cbea7d81aa6d8dc795c8f67ba94e2b9c22351d63191ef0e97377cdf94c
#. default-sha256: d5be4916b385fca9fe9e6995d447171ebfa17a903854b0be29432d93ea98ba21
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_13865182_DB1B_4F73_B3AA_181FDF2483F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Falling in love was an act of villainy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私が誰かと情を交わすこと自体……、⟪k:1⟫悪だったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_D33E3A1B_B033_473B_9FC2_8153900A76B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10c8dec2b7b20f597e8d8cccb7652ced8bbeebc8f426be965f7e8df03a970f9b
